WEBVTT

00:00.910 --> 00:04.690
<b>Episode 10
It's Showtime for Blue Keeper!</b>

00:07.700 --> 00:09.530
<b>What are you…</b>

00:09.530 --> 00:12.950
<b>We're not there yet? I'm getting annoyed.</b>

00:12.950 --> 00:14.950
<b>Be patient. Just a little longer--</b>

00:16.200 --> 00:18.220
<b>Don't you dare order me around.</b>

00:19.540 --> 00:21.950
<b>Want another hole?
</b>

00:21.950 --> 00:24.080
<b>Wait! Please, wait!</b>

00:24.080 --> 00:25.080
<b>What?</b>

00:25.080 --> 00:28.520
<b>This fighter is as good
as a captive with no will to fight back.</b>

00:28.520 --> 00:31.960
<b>They may be our enemy,
but shouldn't we treat them with respect?</b>

00:36.940 --> 00:40.720
<b>Our enemy?
This thing? Don't get the wrong idea.</b>

00:40.720 --> 00:43.080
<b>When we talk about
fighting against monsters,</b>

00:43.490 --> 00:45.520
<b>we are referring to boss monsters.</b>

00:45.950 --> 00:47.940
<b>It doesn't include weakass fighters.
</b>

00:49.580 --> 00:52.670
<b>We're not equals.
They're beneath my notice.</b>

00:52.670 --> 00:54.530
<b>In that case, here's some advice.</b>

00:54.960 --> 01:00.580
<b>A single move from the very thing that is
beneath your notice could cost your life.</b>

01:00.580 --> 01:02.700
<b>What?
Please, let's leave it at that.</b>

01:03.700 --> 01:05.850
<b>It's just a little up ahead, I promise.</b>

01:08.210 --> 01:10.230
<b><i>It was this close?</i></b>

01:10.230 --> 01:14.420
<b><i>Was XX collecting the keys
to prevent the cadets from coming here?</i></b>

01:14.420 --> 01:15.990
<b>Can one of you--</b>

01:15.990 --> 01:17.150
<b>Move.</b>

01:25.700 --> 01:27.370
<b>What the heck is this?</b>

01:34.170 --> 01:37.840
<b>You've grown bigger
since the last time we met.</b>

01:37.840 --> 01:39.370
<b>Are you in your growth spurt?</b>

01:39.370 --> 01:40.800
<b>My, my.</b>

01:40.800 --> 01:45.810
<b>If it isn't Blue Keeper.
It's been a while.</b>

01:45.810 --> 01:47.620
<b>I'm glad to see you.</b>

01:47.620 --> 01:50.690
<b><i>A boss monster…
So they really are alive!</i></b>

01:50.690 --> 01:53.190
<b>I'm truly sorry, Lord Peltrola!</b>

01:53.190 --> 01:57.700
<b>I'm afraid that I must trouble you
due to my incompetence!</b>

01:57.700 --> 02:02.600
<b>Please fulfill our desperate wish
of eliminating the Dragon Keepers now!</b>

02:02.600 --> 02:04.790
<b>Come on,
is that something to talk about</b>

02:04.790 --> 02:06.290
<b>in front of the person in question?</b>

02:06.290 --> 02:10.290
<b>That's dangerous.
Please put down your spear.</b>

02:10.290 --> 02:11.860
<b>Let us talk things out.</b>

02:12.290 --> 02:17.360
<b>I do not want you to resort to
a foolish choice such as violence.</b>

02:17.360 --> 02:21.550
<b>I don't make it a habit to talk to plants.
Shut up and die!</b>

02:21.550 --> 02:23.140
<b>I'm for it!</b>

02:23.140 --> 02:26.750
<b>If you really are a boss monster,
I wish to speak with you.</b>

02:26.750 --> 02:28.440
<b>Huh? Who are you?</b>

02:28.440 --> 02:30.230
<b>Don't get in the way, you weakling.</b>

02:30.230 --> 02:32.020
<b>I'm fighting one-on-one
with that boss monster!</b>

02:33.090 --> 02:36.610
<b>Hey! You've crossed the line.</b>

02:36.610 --> 02:39.990
<b>It's the most heinous of crimes,
easily punishable by death!</b>

02:40.480 --> 02:42.530
<b>Divine Artifact, Manifest!</b>

02:54.020 --> 02:55.530
<b>Lord Peltrola!</b>

03:03.660 --> 03:05.510
<b>You!</b>

03:05.510 --> 03:08.890
<b>How dare you…
 Do not be hasty, XX!</b>

03:08.890 --> 03:11.580
<b>What a foolish surface-dweller.</b>

03:11.580 --> 03:13.690
<b>Realize that you shall never
be able to judge me</b>

03:13.690 --> 03:17.130
<b>with your insignificant standards.
 <i>What's up with their voice?</i></b>

03:17.600 --> 03:19.400
<b>I am an existence</b>

03:19.400 --> 03:22.010
<b>far surpassing you.
</b>

03:36.080 --> 03:38.170
<b>I am God.</b>

03:47.920 --> 03:53.920
<b>Lord Peltrola… You are the light.
Please, guide us!</b>

03:57.670 --> 03:59.510
<b>Interesting.</b>

04:04.090 --> 04:06.010
<b>Go! Go! Loser Ranger!</b>

05:29.900 --> 05:31.560
<b>Divine Artifact, Manifest!</b>

05:40.440 --> 05:43.280
<b>Even a boss monster is no match for him?</b>

05:44.860 --> 05:46.240
<b>Huh?</b>

05:46.790 --> 05:49.010
<b>These guys are gushing out like insects.</b>

05:49.490 --> 05:54.430
<b>This won't end
until you find my real body.</b>

05:57.210 --> 05:58.730
<b>You're annoying!</b>

06:15.730 --> 06:18.620
<b>Wow. They're fighting equally
with that Blue Keeper…</b>

06:18.620 --> 06:20.980
<b>No, it looks like
they have a slight advantage!</b>

06:20.980 --> 06:25.670
<b>Of course.
They are a cut above us fighters.</b>

06:25.670 --> 06:29.490
<b>Boss monsters have the power
to destroy the Rangers!</b>

06:31.030 --> 06:32.160
<b>Lord Peltrola!</b>

06:32.160 --> 06:33.490
<b>H-Hey!</b>

06:33.490 --> 06:37.000
<b>Oh. You're here, XX.</b>

06:37.000 --> 06:39.250
<b>Come, you should pay your respects.</b>

06:39.250 --> 06:43.860
<b>Please do not worry.
He is D, another fighter.</b>

06:43.860 --> 06:47.780
<b>He had once been reduced
to the Rangers' pawn,</b>

06:47.780 --> 06:49.760
<b>but he is now on our side.</b>

06:51.020 --> 06:53.200
<b>What's the matter? Say something.</b>

06:54.490 --> 06:58.770
<b>Lord Peltrola. It's… been a while.</b>

06:59.280 --> 07:03.900
<b>D. You did well to fight
on behalf of us monsters.</b>

07:03.900 --> 07:07.010
<b>You must have suffered considerably.</b>

07:07.010 --> 07:11.260
<b>Thank you for protecting the fortress
while the boss monsters are absent.</b>

07:11.260 --> 07:14.660
<b>Now that I'm here,
there is no need to fear.</b>

07:17.930 --> 07:22.770
<b>We have only one desire,
and that is world domination.</b>

07:22.770 --> 07:24.960
<b>Will you join us?</b>

07:24.960 --> 07:26.900
<b><i>World domination…</i></b>

07:27.460 --> 07:31.470
<b>Now then, shall we send
the Blue Keeper and the other cadets</b>

07:31.470 --> 07:36.870
<b>to where that lamb is?</b>

07:47.400 --> 07:48.530
<b>What?</b>

07:48.530 --> 07:50.780
<b>What?
Huh?</b>

07:50.780 --> 07:53.660
<b>D! What is the meaning of this?</b>

07:53.660 --> 07:56.850
<b>Well, the thing is, um…</b>

07:56.850 --> 07:59.290
<b>My hand kind of slipped
and ended up stabbing you.</b>

07:59.290 --> 08:03.650
<b>A fighter dares rebel
against me, a boss monster?</b>

08:03.650 --> 08:04.960
<b>Preposterous--</b>

08:09.270 --> 08:11.720
<b><i>L-Lord Peltrola…</i></b>

08:13.220 --> 08:17.390
<b>A boss monster… You… What have you…</b>

08:20.110 --> 08:22.770
<b>I… What did I just do?</b>

08:24.620 --> 08:27.790
<b>How could you!
Boss monsters are our birth parents!</b>

08:27.790 --> 08:30.190
<b>Our masters
whom we must swear absolute fealty to!</b>

08:30.190 --> 08:32.050
<b>How could you kill them?</b>

08:32.050 --> 08:34.700
<b>This is unforgivable,
even if the world turns upside down!</b>

08:34.700 --> 08:37.580
<b>When you saved me from Blue Keeper,</b>

08:37.580 --> 08:40.410
<b><i>I almost placed my trust in you again.</i></b>

08:41.160 --> 08:42.960
<b>Tell me!
</b>

08:43.390 --> 08:47.340
<b>Aren't you… our comrade?</b>

08:47.340 --> 08:48.590
<b>Comrade…</b>

08:51.300 --> 08:52.320
<b><i>Damn it.</i></b>

08:52.320 --> 08:56.050
<b><i>I could care less about that guy, so why…</i></b>

08:56.050 --> 08:57.570
<b>Answer me.</b>

08:57.570 --> 09:01.640
<b>Monsters or the Rangers,
which side are you on?</b>

09:03.100 --> 09:05.040
<b>Lord Peltrola!</b>

09:05.700 --> 09:09.690
<b>As expected
of a Dragon Keeper, I guess.</b>

09:10.120 --> 09:13.320
<b>You said that this won't end
until I kill the main body, right?</b>

09:13.320 --> 09:16.840
<b>I'm going to cut down
the numbers quickly and find it!</b>

09:17.780 --> 09:21.490
<b>Blue Keeper!</b>

09:26.580 --> 09:28.610
<b>Blue Keeper.</b>

09:28.610 --> 09:32.400
<b>The truth is that the one
you're dealing with now,</b>

09:32.400 --> 09:34.360
<b>as well as the me right here,</b>

09:34.360 --> 09:36.590
<b>are all my real bodies.</b>

09:36.590 --> 09:40.450
<b>As long as one of me manages
to get to the surface through this hole,</b>

09:40.450 --> 09:43.290
<b>I will have survived.</b>

09:43.290 --> 09:45.390
<b>You've dug your own grave.</b>

09:45.390 --> 09:49.330
<b>I shall once again conserve my strength
silently on the surface,</b>

09:49.330 --> 09:52.400
<b>where food is abundant.</b>

09:54.400 --> 09:55.400
<b>Hmm?</b>

10:00.300 --> 10:03.260
<b>You visit someone's house
and leave without even a greeting…</b>

10:03.260 --> 10:05.040
<b>Isn't that rude?</b>

10:05.510 --> 10:07.190
<b>Boss Monster.</b>

10:07.190 --> 10:10.170
<b>Given our relationship,
there's no need to be shy.</b>

10:10.170 --> 10:12.920
<b>We'll show you some good hospitality.</b>

10:14.190 --> 10:16.300
<b>Divine Artifact, Manifest!</b>

10:16.300 --> 10:18.550
<b>Come, Rangers!</b>

10:30.810 --> 10:31.940
<b>Fast-Forward.</b>

10:43.160 --> 10:44.910
<b>We did it.</b>

10:44.910 --> 10:45.950
<b>Watch your back, old man!</b>

10:50.600 --> 10:54.670
<b>Man, that was awful.
But I'm sure about this taste.</b>

10:55.170 --> 10:57.630
<b>Are you Peltrola?</b>

10:57.630 --> 11:02.160
<b>Oh? To think that someone
who's not a Dragon Keeper knows me.</b>

11:02.160 --> 11:04.430
<b>Are you from the Green Squadron?</b>

11:04.430 --> 11:08.790
<b>You got it. I'm Junior First Rank
Kanon Hisui from the Green Squadron,</b>

11:08.790 --> 11:11.540
<b>specializing in monster elimination
via covert ops.</b>

11:11.540 --> 11:14.690
<b>I've been searching for you
for a long time!</b>

11:18.830 --> 11:20.030
<b>Tokita!</b>

11:29.120 --> 11:30.120
<b>Mute.</b>

11:31.750 --> 11:32.880
<b>Hmm?</b>

11:32.880 --> 11:36.550
<b>Aren't you getting pushed around?
You okay?</b>

11:38.090 --> 11:40.110
<b>If you're a boss monster,</b>

11:40.110 --> 11:41.970
<b>you should get rid of
the Junior First Ranks quickly.</b>

11:42.400 --> 11:43.970
<b>You're…</b>

11:50.270 --> 11:53.020
<b>Now then, what will you do?</b>

11:53.020 --> 11:54.980
<b>This is…
No way…</b>

11:58.530 --> 12:03.470
<b>It appears that I can no longer
rely on the clones that I sent out.</b>

12:03.470 --> 12:06.280
<b>In that case…
 That can't be…</b>

12:06.280 --> 12:08.540
<b>Lord Peltrola!
 Wait!</b>

12:08.540 --> 12:10.870
<b>Let go! I'm going to assist them.</b>

12:10.870 --> 12:13.580
<b>Can't you tell? It's over already!</b>

12:14.510 --> 12:16.540
<b>There is no cause for worry.</b>

12:16.540 --> 12:18.420
<b>Lord Peltrola!
Whoa, you're too close!</b>

12:18.420 --> 12:22.280
<b>Allow me to show you
the true power of a boss monster.</b>

12:22.280 --> 12:26.890
<b>XX. It takes time
for me to use this skill,</b>

12:26.890 --> 12:29.100
<b>so protect me.</b>

12:29.100 --> 12:30.240
<b>Please leave it to me.</b>

12:30.240 --> 12:33.410
<b>Why are you sneaking around?</b>

12:41.940 --> 12:45.280
<b>My precious XX.</b>

12:45.280 --> 12:48.830
<b>You did well to serve me!</b>

12:48.830 --> 12:50.410
<b><i>Damn it…</i></b>

12:50.410 --> 12:56.500
<b><i>They're a boss monster,
yet they used XX as a shield to escape!</i></b>

12:57.310 --> 12:59.750
<b>Lord Monster has arrived!</b>

13:00.350 --> 13:01.940
<b><i>After this and that,</i></b>

13:01.940 --> 13:04.820
<b><i>us monsters finally achieved
world domination.</i></b>

13:04.820 --> 13:07.300
<b>Welcome, Lord Fighter.
 Hmm?</b>

13:07.300 --> 13:09.950
<b>Can I take your coat, Lord XX?</b>

13:09.950 --> 13:12.770
<b>Hey, I'm not XX!
</b>

13:12.770 --> 13:14.770
<b>The name's Fighter D!</b>

13:14.770 --> 13:17.480
<b>P-Please accept our apology!</b>

13:17.950 --> 13:20.650
<b>I'm big-hearted, so I shall forgive you!</b>

13:20.650 --> 13:23.400
<b>You're too kind!</b>

13:24.420 --> 13:26.840
<b>So this is the best cuisine
they have on the surface?</b>

13:27.710 --> 13:28.970
<b>I don't like it.</b>

13:28.970 --> 13:30.810
<b>Hey, chef!
</b>

13:30.810 --> 13:31.990
<b>Did you call for me?</b>

13:33.010 --> 13:34.250
<b>The food was good.</b>

13:34.760 --> 13:38.170
<b>I am so grateful!
My daughter's a fan of yours!</b>

13:40.430 --> 13:42.920
<b><i>What a good world we live in now.</i></b>

13:42.920 --> 13:45.800
<b><i>Wow, this place's awesome!</i></b>

13:45.800 --> 13:48.990
<b>Kurusu, you need to show
some manners here.</b>

13:48.990 --> 13:50.490
<b>Where's the food?</b>

13:50.490 --> 13:51.850
<b>Hey, you all!
 Huh?</b>

13:51.850 --> 13:54.080
<b>Lord Monster
is in the middle of their meal!</b>

13:54.080 --> 13:56.210
<b>Hey! Oh, let them pass.
</b>

13:56.210 --> 13:57.830
<b>They're my guests.</b>

13:57.830 --> 14:00.820
<b>Hey. It's been a while, D.</b>

14:00.820 --> 14:04.110
<b>Pardon me,
but aren't they surface-dwellers?</b>

14:04.110 --> 14:07.840
<b>That's right.
However, they're special.</b>

14:08.360 --> 14:10.970
<b>Eat your fill and make sure
you cherish this moment forever!</b>

14:10.970 --> 14:14.470
<b>There's no need to be shy.
I have 10 billion saved up!</b>

14:14.470 --> 14:15.620
<b>Wow!</b>

14:16.340 --> 14:19.440
<b>My portrait's going to be
on the new bill issued next year!</b>

14:19.440 --> 14:21.000
<b>Your face will be printed on money?</b>

14:21.000 --> 14:23.440
<b><i>My house is 100 times
the size of Tokyo Dome!</i></b>

14:23.440 --> 14:25.630
<b>I see! I don't really get that!</b>

14:25.630 --> 14:29.820
<b><i>I'm ranked
the sexiest monster by women!</i></b>

14:29.820 --> 14:31.390
<b>I'm so mad!</b>

14:31.390 --> 14:34.180
<b>If only I became a Dragon Keeper!
</b>

14:34.610 --> 14:38.370
<b>After all, he dissolved the Ranger Force.</b>

14:38.370 --> 14:40.290
<b>But this was for the better.</b>

14:40.290 --> 14:43.630
<b>We didn't know that the Dragon Keepers
were such horrible people!</b>

14:43.630 --> 14:44.800
<b>Yes, yes.</b>

14:44.800 --> 14:47.900
<b>And we surface-dwellers
are just as guilty.</b>

14:48.630 --> 14:50.470
<b>Now that we've lost the war,</b>

14:50.470 --> 14:54.410
<b>we don't have the right to complain
no matter how the monsters treat us.</b>

14:54.410 --> 14:56.350
<b>Oh, I see.</b>

14:56.350 --> 14:57.660
<b>Lord D.
Huh?</b>

14:57.660 --> 15:00.900
<b>Another guest of yours has arrived.</b>

15:00.900 --> 15:02.060
<b>What?</b>

15:02.540 --> 15:06.150
<b>Oh, this is a nice restaurant.</b>

15:06.670 --> 15:09.430
<b>Oh, Lord Peltrola…</b>

15:09.430 --> 15:12.930
<b>Hmm… Call the chef over.</b>

15:12.930 --> 15:16.040
<b>Lord Boss Monster!
Do you require something from me?</b>

15:16.040 --> 15:18.180
<b>Did you cook these?</b>

15:18.180 --> 15:19.310
<b>Yes!</b>

15:20.450 --> 15:22.190
<b>Fighter D</b>

15:26.690 --> 15:28.440
<b>Know your place.</b>

15:28.960 --> 15:32.510
<b>How dare surface-dwellers,
an existence beneath livestock,</b>

15:32.510 --> 15:35.560
<b>kill other living beings for food?</b>

15:35.560 --> 15:37.290
<b>Unforgivable.</b>

15:37.290 --> 15:38.830
<b>I-I'm really sorry…</b>

15:38.830 --> 15:40.350
<b>You guys, get away!</b>

15:40.350 --> 15:42.750
<b>D, calm down.</b>

15:43.180 --> 15:45.770
<b>We'd give anything
to be killed by a boss monster.</b>

15:46.270 --> 15:47.650
<b>After all,</b>

15:47.650 --> 15:50.170
<b>we surface-dwellers have committed
a mortal sin to deserve this.</b>

15:50.170 --> 15:51.360
<b>But that's…</b>

15:51.360 --> 15:54.550
<b>All right,
this restaurant closes today!</b>

16:02.870 --> 16:05.080
<b><i>Congratulations.</i>
Huh?</b>

16:05.080 --> 16:06.960
<b><i>You've finally achieved your goal.</i></b>

16:07.660 --> 16:09.340
<b>I lost.</b>

16:09.340 --> 16:10.950
<b>Sakurama…</b>

16:10.950 --> 16:14.470
<b>This is what things look like
after the Rangers are destroyed.</b>

16:15.130 --> 16:17.390
<b>It's the world domination
that you've dreamed of.</b>

16:17.390 --> 16:20.620
<b>No.
This isn't what I wanted to do!</b>

16:20.620 --> 16:22.000
<b>Yes, it is.</b>

16:22.430 --> 16:24.770
<b>You just never imagined
what would happen to the world</b>

16:24.770 --> 16:27.270
<b>after achieving world domination.</b>

16:27.270 --> 16:31.190
<b>What you saw will become reality
so long as you destroy the Rangers</b>

16:31.190 --> 16:33.630
<b>while the boss monster is still alive.</b>

16:33.630 --> 16:37.370
<b>The humans who once shared a bond
with you… will all die.</b>

16:37.370 --> 16:40.140
<b>And that includes me too, of course.</b>

16:40.140 --> 16:44.940
<b>Don't you think it's too greedy to expect
that everything will go your way?</b>

16:44.940 --> 16:48.520
<b>It will never happen.
This is an obvious bad move.</b>

16:49.030 --> 16:50.860
<b>It's not too late now.</b>

16:52.360 --> 16:54.210
<b>Please work with me.</b>

16:54.670 --> 16:56.390
<b>Give up on destroying,</b>

16:56.390 --> 16:58.490
<b>and we'll work together
to fix them instead.</b>

16:58.490 --> 17:00.510
<b>I… I…</b>

17:03.590 --> 17:07.000
<b>L-Lord Peltrola…
</b>

17:07.430 --> 17:09.860
<b>Are you safe… Lord Peltrola…</b>

17:09.860 --> 17:11.010
<b>Stop…</b>

17:11.010 --> 17:13.190
<b>I shall join you soon.</b>

17:13.190 --> 17:16.030
<b>I will follow you… Lord Peltrola…</b>

17:16.030 --> 17:18.110
<b>They're not here anymore!</b>

17:19.530 --> 17:21.270
<b>What should I do?</b>

17:21.700 --> 17:25.960
<b>We fighters are created to fight.</b>

17:25.960 --> 17:30.120
<b>For the prosperity of monsters…
To eliminate the Rangers…</b>

17:30.660 --> 17:31.900
<b>Tell me…</b>

17:32.790 --> 17:37.530
<b>What am I supposed to fight for
from this moment on?</b>

17:38.800 --> 17:42.540
<b>I am… a monster.</b>

17:45.090 --> 17:47.670
<b>Oh, seems like you're awake.</b>

17:48.100 --> 17:49.540
<b>What happened to me…</b>

17:49.540 --> 17:51.460
<b>What about the keys?</b>

17:51.890 --> 17:55.300
<b>Apparently, this isn't the time
to be worrying about that.</b>

17:55.300 --> 17:56.820
<b>I don't know what's going on,</b>

17:56.820 --> 17:59.260
<b>but it appears that monsters
have infiltrated the facility.</b>

17:59.260 --> 18:00.780
<b>Anyway, Shion,</b>

18:00.780 --> 18:02.990
<b>you still need us
to lend you our shoulders?</b>

18:02.990 --> 18:04.200
<b>My bad.</b>

18:05.490 --> 18:08.560
<b>I'd prefer if you could do that
since I fractured a bone.</b>

18:08.560 --> 18:10.940
<b>What? Usukubo's pretty good.</b>

18:10.940 --> 18:13.840
<b>The exam should be over by now.</b>

18:13.840 --> 18:15.510
<b>The bell didn't ring, right?</b>

18:15.510 --> 18:16.880
<b>Seems like it's an emergency now,</b>

18:16.880 --> 18:19.890
<b>so don't you think it's still possible
to work together and get back the keys?</b>

18:19.890 --> 18:21.600
<b>Is this even the time to talk about that?</b>

18:21.600 --> 18:23.830
<b>But think about it. Isn't it a good idea?</b>

18:23.830 --> 18:26.480
<b>No, we should stick to the rules.</b>

18:26.480 --> 18:29.130
<b>We don't have the right
to get the keys back.</b>

18:29.130 --> 18:30.310
<b>So stubborn!</b>

18:30.310 --> 18:32.960
<b>You're pretty serious
when it comes to the weirdest things.</b>

18:33.390 --> 18:37.470
<b>I see.
So I couldn't become an official Ranger.</b>

18:37.900 --> 18:42.450
<b>Shion, Akebayashi, Yukino. I'm sorry.</b>

18:42.450 --> 18:43.530
<b>Huh? What's up?</b>

18:43.530 --> 18:45.640
<b>There's no need for you
to apologize, Ishikawa.</b>

18:45.640 --> 18:48.100
<b>No, it's all my fault.</b>

18:48.100 --> 18:51.500
<b>Someone's there! Let's talk later.</b>

18:51.980 --> 18:54.000
<b>Let's get them to protect us now,</b>

18:54.000 --> 18:57.240
<b>and leave the monster extermination work
to the higher-ups…</b>

19:02.210 --> 19:03.780
<b>What's wrong?
</b>

19:06.720 --> 19:09.870
<b>I think I've got the wrong person.</b>

19:09.870 --> 19:11.380
<b>What's that? You're funny.</b>

19:13.540 --> 19:14.170
<b>I'm borrowing this!</b>

19:16.980 --> 19:18.580
<b>Is that really a monster?</b>

19:18.580 --> 19:20.910
<b>Shouldn't we join the fight too?</b>

19:20.910 --> 19:22.450
<b>We've been instructed to evacuate!</b>

19:22.450 --> 19:24.780
<b>Besides, we need to ensure
that Hibiki and Koguma are safe!</b>

19:24.780 --> 19:25.930
<b>Hey, over there!</b>

19:26.930 --> 19:28.790
<b>Was that…
A monster?</b>

19:28.790 --> 19:31.080
<b>It just looked like a bird to me…
</b>

19:31.730 --> 19:33.020
<b>Kurusu!</b>

19:33.020 --> 19:35.940
<b>I don't get it, but I have a feeling
that we can't let it escape!</b>

19:36.400 --> 19:40.030
<b>What? What should we do
at times like this? Hey, Shi…</b>

19:40.030 --> 19:41.130
<b>Shippou!</b>

19:48.830 --> 19:50.210
<b>You're not getting away!</b>

19:56.920 --> 19:58.260
<b>Shion!</b>

19:58.260 --> 19:59.610
<b>A boss monster…</b>

20:00.510 --> 20:02.390
<b>Who are you?</b>

20:02.390 --> 20:05.890
<b>Why do you care? I'm your enemy.</b>

20:06.320 --> 20:09.770
<b>It doesn't matter
if I'm a cadet or an official Ranger.</b>

20:09.770 --> 20:15.270
<b>I'm a human and you're a monster,
and that's enough reason to fight!</b>

20:15.270 --> 20:20.290
<b>Oh, you're a cadet?
That makes you the same as that lamb.</b>

20:21.460 --> 20:26.930
<b>Creating rash people like you
is also the sin of the Rangers.</b>

20:26.930 --> 20:28.660
<b>How pitiful.</b>

20:28.660 --> 20:31.980
<b>I shall send all of you to where he is.</b>

20:31.980 --> 20:34.040
<b>Are you talking about Ranmaru?</b>

20:35.540 --> 20:37.300
<b>Urabe!
So you're safe!</b>

20:37.300 --> 20:40.420
<b>Are you the one who took out Ranmaru?</b>

20:41.670 --> 20:45.110
<b>He was a foolish lamb
who pointed a blade at me,</b>

20:45.110 --> 20:49.270
<b>unable to escape from the Rangers' curse.</b>

20:50.430 --> 20:53.230
<b>To prevent further futile conflicts,</b>

20:53.350 --> 20:57.670
<b>it appears that it is finally time
to let the surface-dwellers know.</b>

20:57.670 --> 21:00.760
<b>The countless atrocities
that the Rangers have committed,</b>

21:00.760 --> 21:03.570
<b>as well as the might of us monsters.</b>

21:03.570 --> 21:06.260
<b>This one really seems
to detest the Rangers.</b>

21:06.260 --> 21:08.160
<b>It's a monster, after all.</b>

21:08.160 --> 21:11.770
<b>Still, we have the right to be mad
since our comrade was taken out!</b>

21:11.770 --> 21:15.330
<b>Hey, boss monster. Fight us
before you head out to the surface.</b>

21:15.330 --> 21:16.460
<b>Hmm…</b>

21:16.460 --> 21:19.190
<b>We're worthy of it, aren't we?
I agree.</b>

21:19.190 --> 21:20.840
<b>We also are…</b>

21:20.840 --> 21:23.090
<b>the Rangers!
 The Rangers!</b>

21:23.090 --> 21:25.470
<b>This is why you'll all die!</b>

21:30.610 --> 21:34.480
<b><i>I'm a monster.
I'll destroy anyone who gets in my way.</i></b>

21:35.230 --> 21:38.610
<b><i>You guys are the ones
who made us this way.</i></b>

21:38.610 --> 21:41.050
<b><i>I won't side with anyone.</i></b>

21:41.050 --> 21:43.130
<b><i>I am on my own side.</i></b>

21:43.130 --> 21:45.050
<b><i>You may be a boss monster,</i></b>

21:45.050 --> 21:47.210
<b><i>but you're my enemy
if your ideals differ from mine!</i></b>

21:48.120 --> 21:50.240
<b><i>I'll gladly be greedy.</i></b>

21:50.670 --> 21:52.430
<b><i>I'll even make a bad move.</i></b>

21:52.430 --> 21:54.520
<b><i>I'm a nefarious monster.</i></b>

21:54.520 --> 21:58.500
<b><i>I won't be satisfied
until everything goes my way!</i></b>

23:29.310 --> 23:31.470
<b>Translated by Qianni Lu</b>

23:31.470 --> 23:34.410
<b>Come, let's compete! The one
who eats more plates of sushi passes!</b>

23:34.410 --> 23:36.020
<b>I'm going to win.
 Huh?</b>

23:36.020 --> 23:37.140
<b>Oh, you're kidding!</b>

23:37.140 --> 23:39.100
<b>I'm going to have at least 30 plates!</b>

23:39.100 --> 23:41.850
<b>What? I'll have at least 31 plates!
I have another stomach for sushi!</b>

23:41.850 --> 23:43.860
<b><i>Next episode,
"On the Road to My Justice!"</i></b>

23:43.860 --> 23:44.960
<b>My stomach's a universe!</b>

23:44.960 --> 23:46.480
<b>Stop talking and start eating, Sakurama.</b>
